{"additional":"","additionalPlain":"","categories":{"commitment":"Full Time","department":"PH","location":"Philippines","team":"Delta","allLocations":["Philippines"]},"createdAt":1784641527800,"descriptionPlain":"Please whitelist the domains \"lever.co\" and \"hire.lever.co\" with your email provider to make sure you get our emails.\nDisclaimer: This is a generic job description for the position stated below. Actual tasks and tools will be discussed further when you reach the final interview stage. Please ensure you apply for the right job based on your location and experience. We prioritize people who can do this successfully!\nIT Project Manager (Remote)\nWing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies worldwide! We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams & place their operations on autopilot.\nAnd we’re looking for an IT Project Manager to start immediately!\nDuties and Responsibilities include but are not limited to:\nManage timelines for 60+ simultaneous projects by creating project plans, launch targets, and milestone schedules.\nIdentify project risks and proactively recommend solutions to keep projects on track.\nTrack project tasks, deliverables, and resource assignments to ensure timely execution.\nCommunicate project status, risks, and mitigation plans clearly with internal teams and stakeholders.\nUpdate and maintain project information in ClickUp.\nCollaborate closely with the existing Wing assistant to ensure project continuity.\nEscalate project issues when necessary and execute appropriate follow-up actions.\nEnsure multiple projects progress according to schedule while maintaining quality and accountability.\nQualifications:\n• Experience managing multiple concurrent IT projects independently\n• Intermediate to advanced experience with ClickUp or similar project management platforms (e.g., Asana or Monday.com)\n• Strong understanding of IT and software implementation environments, including test environments, production environments, and system integrations\n• Excellent project planning, organization, and time management skills\n• Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities with a proactive approach to risk management\n• Excellent written and verbal communication skills\n• Ability to work autonomously with minimal supervision\nTechnical Requirements:\n• USB Headset with Noise Cancellation feature\n• Working Webcam\n• Computer with at least 1.8 GHz processor and at least 4GB RAM\n• Main Internet Service Speed: at least 25 Mbps cable connection\n• Backup Internet Service Speed: at least 10 Mbps\nBenefits:\n• Performance Incentives\n• Job Security and Stability\n• Paid Training\n• Inclusive Culture\n• Upskilling Opportunities\n• 100% Work-From-Home\n• Exceptionally Supportive Team\n• Opportunities for Career Growth\n• Fun Work Environment\n• Holiday & Overtime Pay\nLocation: This is a remote job\nSalary Package:\n• PHP 89,000\nPlease note:\n• Only qualified candidates will be invited to take the assessment & scheduled for an interview.\n• We have other vacancies that might interest your friends & colleagues. They can check us out at our Jobs Website.\n• You may also refer your friends using our Affiliate Marketing Program and earn up to $30 if your referral is hired.\n","description":"<div>\n<p>Please whitelist the domains \"lever.co\" and \"hire.lever.co\" with your email provider to make sure you get our emails.</p>\n<p>Disclaimer: This is a generic job description for the position stated below. Actual tasks and tools will be discussed further when you reach the final interview stage. Please ensure you apply for the right job based on your location and experience. We prioritize people who can do this successfully!</p>\n<p><strong>IT Project Manager (Remote)</strong></p>\n<p>Wing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies worldwide! We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams &amp; place their operations on autopilot.</p>\n<p>And we’re looking for an IT Project Manager to start immediately!</p>\n<h3>Duties and Responsibilities include but are not limited to:</h3>\n<ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\">\n<li>Manage timelines for 60+ simultaneous projects by creating project plans, launch targets, and milestone schedules.</li>\n<li>Identify project risks and proactively recommend solutions to keep projects on track.</li>\n<li>Track project tasks, deliverables, and resource assignments to ensure timely execution.</li>\n<li>Communicate project status, risks, and mitigation plans clearly with internal teams and stakeholders.</li>\n<li>Update and maintain project information in ClickUp.</li>\n<li>Collaborate closely with the existing Wing assistant to ensure project continuity.</li>\n<li>Escalate project issues when necessary and execute appropriate follow-up actions.</li>\n<li>Ensure multiple projects progress according to schedule while maintaining quality and accountability.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Qualifications:</h3>\n<p>• Experience managing multiple concurrent IT projects independently<br>• Intermediate to advanced experience with ClickUp or similar project management platforms (e.g., Asana or Monday.com)<br>• Strong understanding of IT and software implementation environments, including test environments, production environments, and system integrations<br>• Excellent project planning, organization, and time management skills<br>• Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities with a proactive approach to risk management<br>• Excellent written and verbal communication skills<br>• Ability to work autonomously with minimal supervision</p>\n<h3>Technical Requirements:</h3>\n<p>• USB Headset with Noise Cancellation feature<br>• Working Webcam<br>• Computer with at least 1.8 GHz processor and at least 4GB RAM<br>• Main Internet Service Speed: at least 25 Mbps cable connection<br>• Backup Internet Service Speed: at least 10 Mbps</p>\n<h3>Benefits:</h3>\n<h3>• Performance Incentives<br>• Job Security and Stability<br>• Paid Training<br>• Inclusive Culture<br>• Upskilling Opportunities<br>• 100% Work-From-Home<br>• Exceptionally Supportive Team<br>• Opportunities for Career Growth<br>• Fun Work Environment<br>• Holiday &amp; Overtime Pay</h3>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> This is a remote job</p>\n<h3>Salary Package:</h3>\n<p>• <strong>PHP 89,000</strong></p>\n<p>Please note:<br>• Only qualified candidates will be invited to take the assessment &amp; scheduled for an interview.<br>• We have other vacancies that might interest your friends &amp; colleagues. They can check us out at our Jobs Website.<br>• You may also refer your friends using our Affiliate Marketing Program and earn up to $30 if your referral is hired.</p>\n</div>","id":"48f3af95-e567-4a2e-97b7-a1a3cd2ec434","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"min":80000,"max":89000,"currency":"PHP","interval":"per-month-salary"},"text":"IT Project Manager","country":"PH","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<p>Please whitelist the domains \"lever.co\" and \"hire.lever.co\" with your email provider to make sure you get our emails.</p>\n<p>Disclaimer: This is a generic job description for the position stated below. Actual tasks and tools will be discussed further when you reach the final interview stage. Please ensure you apply for the right job based on your location and experience. We prioritize people who can do this successfully!</p>\n<p><strong>IT Project Manager (Remote)</strong></p>\n<p>Wing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies worldwide! We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams &amp; place their operations on autopilot.</p>\n<p>And we&rsquo;re looking for an IT Project Manager to start immediately!</p>\n<h3>Duties and Responsibilities include but are not limited to:</h3>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Manage timelines for 60+ simultaneous projects by creating project plans, launch targets, and milestone schedules.</li>\n<li>Identify project risks and proactively recommend solutions to keep projects on track.</li>\n<li>Track project tasks, deliverables, and resource assignments to ensure timely execution.</li>\n<li>Communicate project status, risks, and mitigation plans clearly with internal teams and stakeholders.</li>\n<li>Update and maintain project information in ClickUp.</li>\n<li>Collaborate closely with the existing Wing assistant to ensure project continuity.</li>\n<li>Escalate project issues when necessary and execute appropriate follow-up actions.</li>\n<li>Ensure multiple projects progress according to schedule while maintaining quality and accountability.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Qualifications:</h3>\n<p>&bull; Experience managing multiple concurrent IT projects independently<br>&bull; Intermediate to advanced experience with ClickUp or similar project management platforms (e.g., Asana or Monday.com)<br>&bull; Strong understanding of IT and software implementation environments, including test environments, production environments, and system integrations<br>&bull; Excellent project planning, organization, and time management skills<br>&bull; Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities with a proactive approach to risk management<br>&bull; Excellent written and verbal communication skills<br>&bull; Ability to work autonomously with minimal supervision</p>\n<h3>Technical Requirements:</h3>\n<p>&bull; USB Headset with Noise Cancellation feature<br>&bull; Working Webcam<br>&bull; Computer with at least 1.8 GHz processor and at least 4GB RAM<br>&bull; Main Internet Service Speed: at least 25 Mbps cable connection<br>&bull; Backup Internet Service Speed: at least 10 Mbps</p>\n<h3>Benefits:</h3>\n<h3>&bull; Performance Incentives<br>&bull; Job Security and Stability<br>&bull; Paid Training<br>&bull; Inclusive Culture<br>&bull; Upskilling Opportunities<br>&bull; 100% Work-From-Home<br>&bull; Exceptionally Supportive Team<br>&bull; Opportunities for Career Growth<br>&bull; Fun Work Environment<br>&bull; Holiday &amp; Overtime Pay</h3>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> This is a remote job</p>\n<h3>Salary Package:</h3>\n<p>&bull; <strong>PHP 89,000</strong></p>\n<p>Please note:<br>&bull; Only qualified candidates will be invited to take the assessment &amp; scheduled for an interview.<br>&bull; We have other vacancies that might interest your friends &amp; colleagues. They can check us out at our Jobs Website.<br>&bull; You may also refer your friends using our Affiliate Marketing Program and earn up to $30 if your referral is hired.</p>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"Please whitelist the domains \"lever.co\" and \"hire.lever.co\" with your email provider to make sure you get our emails.\nDisclaimer: This is a generic job description for the position stated below. Actual tasks and tools will be discussed further when you reach the final interview stage. Please ensure you apply for the right job based on your location and experience. We prioritize people who can do this successfully!\nIT Project Manager (Remote)\nWing is on the exciting mission of redefining the future of work for companies worldwide! We are looking to be the one-stop shop for companies that are looking to build world-class teams & place their operations on autopilot.\nAnd we’re looking for an IT Project Manager to start immediately!\nDuties and Responsibilities include but are not limited to:\nManage timelines for 60+ simultaneous projects by creating project plans, launch targets, and milestone schedules.\nIdentify project risks and proactively recommend solutions to keep projects on track.\nTrack project tasks, deliverables, and resource assignments to ensure timely execution.\nCommunicate project status, risks, and mitigation plans clearly with internal teams and stakeholders.\nUpdate and maintain project information in ClickUp.\nColla